- [Plugin Components](/docs/plugin-components) for replacing `renderElement` and `renderLeaf`.
- [Plugin Methods](/docs/plugin-methods) for `.configure()` and typed `.extend()` contributions.
- [Plugin Shortcuts](/docs/plugin-shortcuts) for keyboard command wiring.
